{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JTSUQgrT5GA1P3a2m2MPQ1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Cloudflare Agents SDK Channels import \"agents\"\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"Build AI agents that remember, reason, and act\",\"url\":\"https://www.cloudflare.com/product/agents\"},{\"title\":\"Bringing more agent harnesses and frameworks to Cloudflare, starting with Flue\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/author/thomas-gauvin/\"},{\"title\":\"# Build Agents on Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://3814b206.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/llms-full.txt\"},{\"title\":\"# Build Agents on Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://thomasgauvin-nit-hyperdrive-formatting-code-snippet.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/developer-platform/llms-full.txt\"},{\"title\":\"# Build Agents on Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://hyperlint-automation-repository-scan-d9984c1.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/developer-platform/llms-full.txt\"},{\"title\":\"# Build Agents on Cloudflare\",\"url\":\"https://c9de6e9d.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/developer-platform/llms-full.txt\"},{\"title\":\"8f23c8e1.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://8f23c8e1.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"13213614.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://13213614.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up documentation of a \"Channels\" export imported from `\"agents\"`. The closest match is an import from `'agents'` in an example, which is not a Channels API.\n\n- **Channels are a documented concept.** The docs describe communication channels define how users and systems reach your agent, such as chat, email, voice, Slack, and webhooks. Each has its own page under `/agents/communication-channels/`.\n- **The `'agents'` import in the results is `routeAgentRequest`.** A Cloudflare product page example imports it from `'agents'` alongside `AIChatAgent` from `@cloudflare/ai-chat`. That example shows routing and chat, not a Channels module.\n- **Core `Agent` class.** The reference docs for the SDK package cover defining an `Agent` class, though the snippets don't show its import path.\n- **Recent framing.** A Cloudflare blog post says the Agents SDK is now a runtime any agent framework can build on. It names Flue as the first framework targeting it.\n\nSeveral results are preview-domain copies of the same docs page, dated around August 2026. None show the exact `import { ... } from \"agents\"` line for Channels. Checking the Slack or Webhooks pages under `developers.cloudflare.com/agents/communication-channels/` would be the next step to confirm the actual import.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"afcd24a2-086e-45d4-afc9-20308c12760f","uuid":"b33c9d44-d7c6-41df-beaa-6d30d1f89a20","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:13:55.780Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Cloudflare Agents SDK Channels import \"agents\"","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01S2wdL4VuXGCjkxHv6hfcov","content":[{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/index.md"},{"title":"Build AI agents that remember, reason, and act","url":"https://www.cloudflare.com/product/agents"},{"title":"Bringing more agent harnesses and frameworks to Cloudflare, starting with Flue","url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/author/thomas-gauvin/"},{"title":"# Build Agents on Cloudflare","url":"https://3814b206.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/llms-full.txt"},{"title":"# Build Agents on Cloudflare","url":"https://thomasgauvin-nit-hyperdrive-formatting-code-snippet.preview.developers.cloudflare.com/developer-platform/llms-full.txt"},{"title":"# Build Agents on Cloudflare","url":"https://hyperlint-automation-repository-scan-d9984c1.pr